SUMMARY: Dance for Non-Dancers @ Soulpepper
DESCRIPTION:This class will get you moving! Encouraging imagination\, flu
 idity\, dynamic physicality\, sensory and spatial awareness\, we promote 
 a generous space of playful engagement and dialogue. Taught by veteran da
 nce artist\, Bonnie Kim\, this class is for every body and everybody. Bri
 ng your curiosity\, we’ll bring the awesome tunes!\n\nRegistration is ope
 n for the following dates:\n\nApril 10\nApril 17\nApril 24\nMay 1\nMay 8\
 nMay 15\n\nPlease register at the following link: https://tickets.youngce
 ntre.ca/15949 https://tickets.youngcentre.ca/15949 .\n\nFor questions ema
 il: maricris.rivera@soulpepper.ca mailto:maricris.rivera@soulpepper.ca
