SUMMARY: Maplee Vendor Market - May Long Weekend
DESCRIPTION:Join us this May Long Weekend for the Maplee Vendor Market on
  Gristmill Lane in The Distillery Historic District.\n\nThis outdoor mark
 et features a curated selection of Canadian vendors across fashion\, art\
 , handmade goods\, lifestyle\, wellness\, specialty food\, and more. Set 
 within one of Toronto’s most iconic pedestrian destinations\, the market 
 brings together local brands and visitors for a vibrant long weekend shop
 ping experience in the heart of The Distillery Historic District.\n\nVisi
 tors can explore unique products\, discover emerging businesses\, and enj
 oy the energy of The Distillery District throughout the weekend.\n\n
