 country-pop with a dynamic\, crowd-pleasing sound. Eric\, frontman of Shy
  Harry\, is known for a voice reminiscent of Eddie Vedder and Chris Corne
 ll\, with over a decade of performances across Ontario. Jessie T blends c
 ountry roots with a pop-rock edge\, earning multiple CMAO nominations and
  sharing stages with Dallas Smith and James Barker Band.
