SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: Kirt Godwin & Jesse Labovitz
DESCRIPTION:JUNO-nominated guitarist and vocalist Kirt Godwin teams up wi
 th drummer Jesse Labovitz for a dynamic set of rock\, funk\, and soul\, b
 lending timeless hits with deeper groove-driven cuts. Kirt has shared the
  stage with artists like Ed Sheeran\, Our Lady Peace\, and The Reklaws\, 
 while Jesse tours with acts including No Warning and The Headstones. Toge
 ther\, they deliver a tight\, high-energy performance rooted in chemistry
  and feel.
