SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: Brasa
DESCRIPTION:Brasa - named for the Portuguese word for “ember” - captures 
 the burning soul of Brazil’s rich musical legacy. Led by keyboardist and 
 vocalist João Leão (a.k.a. Johny Lion)\, a product of São Paulo’s vibrant
  indie scene\, the ensemble ignites the stage with a dynamic mix of Brazi
 lian Soul\, Samba-Rock\, and Tropicália. Their set pays homage to legends
  like Jorge Ben\, João Donato\, and Marcos Valle\, while also spotlightin
 g standout tracks from Brazil’s new wave of indie artists.
