SUMMARY: TO the Beat
DESCRIPTION:TO the Beat is a free outdoor concert series presented as par
 t of the Lavazza IncluCity Festival and hosted at The Distillery Historic
  District in Toronto from June 25–July 19\, 2026\, with performances begi
 nning nightly at 6:30 PM. Celebrating the diversity and vibrancy of Toron
 to’s music scene\, the series brings together artists from a wide range o
 f cultural backgrounds and musical styles\, showcasing the rhythms\, trad
 itions\, and stories that shape the city’s rich cultural mosaic. From glo
 bal sounds to homegrown talent\, TO the Beat invites audiences to come to
 gether\, dance\, and experience live music in the heart of the city.
