SUMMARY: Victory - Presented by the ICFF Festival at the Distillery Distr
 ict
DESCRIPTION:One game. One chance for freedom.\n\nJoin the ICFF for the sc
 reening of Victory\, a sports drama that brings together the intensity of
  wartime resistance and the power of soccer. Before the film\, guests can
  enjoy soccer-themed activations and interactive experiences.\n\nSet duri
 ng World War II\, Victory follows a group of Allied prisoners of war who 
 are recruited to play a highly publicized football match against a German
  team in occupied Paris. As they prepare for the game\, the players secre
 tly plan an escape\, forcing them to choose between freedom and finishing
  the match that has become a symbol of pride and resistance. Featuring le
 gendary soccer stars alongside a stellar cast\, Victory delivers a thrill
 ing story of teamwork\, determination\, and the enduring human spirit.\n\
 nExperience a cinematic celebration of sport\, resilience\, and the momen
 ts that bring people together both on and off the field.
CATEGORIES:Toronto,film,soccer,movie
