SUMMARY: Summer Live Music Series: Conor Gains & The Canadian Tuxedos
DESCRIPTION:Conor Gains & The Canadian Tuxedos are bringing the ultimate 
 Canada Day party to the stage. Featuring members of Bahamas\, Blue Rodeo\
 , and City and Colour\, this all-star Canadian outfit celebrates the soun
 dtrack of our nation with an afternoon of iconic Canadian hits\, roots\, 
 rock\, folk\, and sing-along favourites. Clad in full Canadian tuxedo att
 ire (yes\, all denim)\, the band delivers a high-energy tribute to the ar
 tists and songs that have shaped generations of Canadians. Grab a drink\,
  wave a flag\, and get ready to sing along. Canada never sounded so good.
